 {"sec": "IDA features, investigations and treatment · p237", "page": 237, "q": "On the peripheral smear of IDA, hypochromia means pallor of more than ___ of the cell.", "opts": ["1/3", "1/2", "1/4", "2/3"], "ans": 0, "exp": "Hypochromia = pallor > 1/3 of the cell. (Book p237)", "type": "fill", "id": "PEDS-C50-092"},
