 {"sec": "IDA features, investigations and treatment · p237", "page": 237, "q": "The dose of ferrous sulphate for IDA is —", "opts": ["0.5 mg/kg/day", "3–6 mg/kg/day", "1–2 mg/kg/day", "10–15 mg/kg/day"], "ans": 1, "exp": "Dose: 3–6 mg/kg/day. (Book p237)", "type": "mcq", "id": "PEDS-C50-097"},
