 {"sec": "IDA features, investigations and treatment · p237", "page": 237, "q": "The deworming drug used as supplementary therapy in IDA is —", "opts": ["Ivermectin", "Albendazole", "Praziquantel", "Metronidazole"], "ans": 1, "exp": "Supplementary therapy: dietary modification and deworming with albendazole. (Book p237)", "type": "mcq", "id": "PEDS-C50-105"},
